dsh-postman README · Host half：- Single-file mode (no `dir`): stored at `~/.dsh/uploads/<timestamp>-<file>`;
- Folder mode (shared `dir` per batch): stored at `~/.dsh/uploads/<dir>/<rel>`,
  directories auto-created, name collisions get `-2/-3`, never overwritten;
- 25 MiB per file; `dir` may not contain path separators, `rel` is sanitized segment
  by segment and drops `..`; dirs `0700`, files `0600`; cross-origin requests rejected;
- Envelope: `{ ok: true, value: { name, path, root, size, kind, preview } }` — for
  `kind === 'text'`, `preview` carries the first 20k UTF-8 chars.
